    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The importance Aga Khan University (AKU) places on research has been recognised through the publication of a special edition of the journal, Scholarship of Teaching & Learning (SoTL) in the South, which dedicated its April 2019 edition to work done by AKU faculty.",
